pace role behind the API key or OAuth sign-in lacks `flowsery.write`; `role`, `keyRole` and `issuerRole` say which role fell short. `code: subscription_required`: the organization plan does not include API access. `code: workspace_access_denied`: `X-Workspace-Id` names a workspace the caller cannot reach, or an API key was sent to a workspace other than its own","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Website not found","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"429":{"description":"Rate limit exceeded","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}},"parameters":[{"name":"X-Workspace-Id","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The workspace to act in, for OAuth sign-ins that reach several workspaces. Take the id from `GET /workspaces`. Without it the call lands in the default workspace. A workspace the caller cannot reach answers 403 with `code: workspace_access_denied`. An API key belongs to one workspace: send its own id or leave the header out"}]},"delete":{"operationId":"deleteGoalCompletions","summary":"Delete goal completions","description":"Deletes recorded completions matching the filter. At least one of `visitorId`, `name`, `startAt` or `endAt` is required, so an unfiltered call cannot wipe the whole history by accident.","tags":["Events"],"parameters":[{"name":"websiteId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Website to query. Optional when the API key is scoped to a single website; required for workspace tokens that span several."},{"name":"domain","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Alternative to `websiteId`: select the website by its domain."},{"name":"visitorId","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Delete completions belonging to this visitor."},{"name":"name","in":"query","require